{
  "_doc": [
    "Shop catalog (V2 'OPEN SHOP' menus, command blocks at 43,165,-37..-47). python tools/build_shop.py writes",
    "datapack/data/nonios/function/shop/catalog.mcfunction (storage nonios:shop items + sections). Edit prices here, rebuild, /reload.",
    "sections: shown in this order on the shop's first page; line = the Shop Keeper's V2 flavour line for that page.",
    "  classes: true = the page lists the classes from src/classes.json (tools/build_classes.py -> class/gen/shop_items).",
    "items: v2 = V2 WhiteShop id (reference only). name = button label. price = coins from the purse.",
    "  kind item (default): give id x count with components (raw 26.3 item components, JSON form). Needs a free slot.",
    "  kind enchant: enchants the item in the main hand (ench, lvl). Refused, nothing taken, if the item can't take it.",
    "  kind xp: adds lvl levels.",
    "  icon = 'item/<tex>' (items atlas) or 'block/<tex>' (blocks atlas). blurb = V2 hover text (tooltip). chat = text component sent to the buyer.",
    "The same V2 item can sit on several pages (V2 did that too); each entry is its own button.",
    "References: {same: v2} copies an earlier item, {special: id} = src/specials.json, {class: id, name, v2} = a class under another label."
  ],
